# Who is allowed to see what. Checked both in the API and in the UI.

Test: Regular users cannot see admin data

  Start with: one user "rahim@test.com"
  Users: customer, admin

  As customer:
    call GET /api/admin/users
    backend should reply 403
    go to users page
    should see "Access denied"

  As admin:
    call GET /api/admin/users
    backend should reply 200
    reply total should be 1
    reply users[0].email should be "rahim@test.com"
    reply should not contain password
